---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy: How I Handle Your Data | Colin Robey" description="How colinrobey.ca handles data: privacy-first analytics with consent, no advertising, no cross-site tracking, no selling data." crumbs={[{ name: 'Privacy', href: '/privacy/' }]}>
  <main id="main">
    <section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p><h1>How I handle your data.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Short version: no advertising, no cross-site tracking, no selling data. A page counter that can’t tell who you are always runs; Google Analytics only runs after you say yes.</p></div></section>
    <section class="section--tight" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap prose">
      <h2>What I collect</h2>
      <p>Every visit adds one line to a page counter I run on this domain: the date, the page, and the site you came from (for example, LinkedIn or Google). That’s all it stores. No cookie, no identifier, no IP address, nothing that could tell one visitor from another, which is why it doesn’t ask first.</p>
      <p>When you accept the cookie banner, this site uses Google Analytics 4 to understand how people find the site and which pages they read. It records things like pages viewed, rough location (city or region), and the type of device and browser. IP addresses are anonymized. I never see your name, email, or any identifying detail from analytics.</p>
      <h2>If you contact me</h2>
      <p>When you send a message or request a scorecard, I receive what you type (your name, email, website and message) so I can reply and do the work. I use it only for that. I don’t add you to a marketing list without asking, and I don’t share it with anyone else.</p>
      <h2>Third parties</h2>
      <p>The only third-party service that touches your visit is Google Analytics, and only after consent. Fonts are self-hosted on this domain. Forms are handled by Netlify, the host that serves this site. The speed checker sends the address you type to Google’s PageSpeed Insights service, and nothing else.</p>
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>Send me a message and I’ll answer honestly. If you want your form submission deleted, just ask.</p>
    </div></section>
  </main>
</Base>
